          "interaction": 181
        },
        {
          "handle": "josepozophotonics",
          "platform": "LinkedIn",
          "text": "THE TWO-YEAR CLOCK ON CO-PACKAGED OPTICS: A NINE-MONTH SCOREBOARD Last September, at ECOC in Copenhagen, I chaired a fireside session on the Market Focus stage that I still think about. We put three companies up there, each holding one piece of a puzzle nobody has solved yet: how do you get co-packa",
          "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7478551791337590785/",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T10:16:29.216+08:00",
          "interaction": 33
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "The main proposition of NPO is that the optical engine is nearer to the switch ASIC than pluggable solution to reduce the electrical path, while the OE itself is not in the same packaging as the switch ASIC. Hence, the main distinction between NPO and CPO is the placement of the",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2086860581617684533",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T01:01:49.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 28
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Another distinction is that the NPO module will be replaceable and serviceable, while most CPO design does not allow the OE to be replaceable. The NPO module will connect to the high performance substrate via a socket device. (3/3)",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2086860582972461343",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T01:01:49.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 28
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "NPO 在從可插拔光模組過渡到真正 CPO 的過程中，提出了一種過渡方案。 NPO 相較於 CPO 有一些優勢，能避開目前 CPO 在量產與可靠性上的挑戰，同時仍能保有 CPO 大部分的優點。  優點： - 更好的可維修性（現場可更換） - 更小的故障影響範圍（爆炸半徑僅限於單一 NPO 模組） - 組裝更容易（光學引擎與",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2087063212449534072",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T14:27:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 22
        }
